{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2023-05-16 09:17:00', 'title': 'DYMO® REVEALS OVER HALF OF SMALL BUSINESSES MISLABEL DOCUMENTS AT LEAST OCCASIONALLY AND SEEK BETTER ORGANIZATION', 'text': 'RECENT SURVEY SHOWS OFFICE MANAGERS ARE PRIORITIZING EFFICIENCY AND WASTE REDUCTION DESPITE MACRO FACTORS ATLANTA , MAY 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DYMO®, A LEADING MANUFACTURER OF LABEL MAKERS AND LABEL PRINTERS AND PART OF THE NEWELL BRANDS PORTFOLIO OF BRANDS, SURVEYED* SMALL BUSINESS OFFICE MANAGERS ACROSS THREE MARKETS INCLUDING THE UNITED STATES, UNITED KINGDOM AND GERMANY TO GAUGE THE TOP PRIORITIES AND CONCERNS FOR OPERATIONS THIS YEAR, AS WELL AS MACRO FACTORS LIKE ECONOMIC CONDITIONS AND SHIFTING WORKPLACE DEMANDS.\xa0 THE SURVEY REVEALS THAT SMALL BUSINESS OFFICE MANAGERS ARE MOST LOOKING FORWARD TO OPPORTUNITIES FOR GROWTH (58%), FOLLOWED CLOSELY BY ENHANCEMENT IN EFFICIENCY AND PROCESSES (57%).'}